	"Description": "Kit mods (M11 G4, combat-loadout-mods.md §8): mod definitions, the kit's mod slots and limits, the player's mod choices as a loadout extension, and the pure baking of derived timelines (time, reach, hitbox size, damage, knockback, hitstop, stagger, added tags) at loadout compile. Nothing runs in the simulation: the rollback tick only reads the baked data.",
